  "notes": {
    "roads": "highway=value -> path_type of the shared road prefab. GUESSED groupings by road hierarchy — pa_road.tscn has 7 visual variants in CoK (17,18,19,20,21,22,23) and there's no way to know which looks like what without opening the editor. Draw one segment of each path_type in CoK and re-map these to match reality.",
    "bridge": "GUESSED — a way tagged highway=* + bridge=yes/viaduct/... uses this asset instead of a plain road. CoK ships two bridge prefabs, pa_bridge_1.tscn (path_type 34, the more common one in the reference template.mommap) and pa_bridge_2.tscn (path_type 35) — picked pa_bridge_1 as the default with no way to tell them apart visually without the editor open. Swap to pa_bridge_2 (or split by road class/width) after checking what each looks like.",
    "buildings": "GUESSED — CoK has no direct equivalent for most OSM building/amenity/shop types. Rules are evaluated top to bottom, first tag match wins; 'default' catches everything else (plain building=house/yes/residential/industrial/... all fall through to generic huts). Expect to redo this after looking at the result in the editor.",
    "farmland_polygon": "\"посадки\" — cultivated/planted land (farmland, orchards, vineyards, tree nurseries, meadows)."
  },
